{{!--
    Wraps a logical page section.

    AsciiDoc has no DOM-style wrapper that scopes styling over multiple
    blocks (the `[.role]` attribute attaches only to the next block,
    not to everything that follows), so this variant just passes the
    body through.  The `name` and `id` parameters are accepted for
    parity with the HTML variant and reserved for future use.

    Parameters:
        name: optional CSS class / AsciiDoc role for the section.
        id:   optional HTML id / AsciiDoc anchor for the section.
--}}
